flowchart TD
    A[Define area of interest and emergency-planning purpose] --> B{Authoritative source identified?}
    B -- No --> R[Write DATA GAP report]
    B -- Yes --> C[Load FEMA Flood Hazard Zones or documented local study]
    C --> D{Coverage verified for entire area?}
    D -- No --> E[Create NO DATA mask and record partial coverage]
    D -- Yes --> F[Record complete coverage]
    E --> G{Explicit 0.2% annual-chance subtype present?}
    F --> G
    G -- No --> R
    G -- Yes --> H[Verify dates, URL, CRS, datum, and source metadata]
    I[Hazard scope: riverine, coastal, pluvial, levee, dam failure] --> J[Honesty Engine]
    K[Changed conditions, calibration, uncertainty, independent review] --> J
    H --> J
    J --> L{Screening publication gate}
    L -- Closed --> M[Write honesty report; produce no distributable polygon]
    L -- Open --> N[Extract explicit 0.2% features]
    N --> O[Clip to area of interest]
    O --> P[Embed mandatory MAP_LABEL]
    P --> Q[Export screening layer plus honesty report and no-data mask]
    Q --> S[Independent review and comparison with effective FEMA products]
    S --> T[Emergency-management screening product]
    T --> U[Not insurance, permitting, code, lending, or parcel determination]
